When you deactivate Vaporous Step, if the psychoport succeeds you inhale some of the vapours, regenerating [5, 15, 22, 29, 35 (TL1-5)] steam and [183, 239, 283, 320, 353 (TL1-5; MP 100)] life.

The effects will be multiplied by 33% (diminutive) for each charge of Vaporous Step.

The healing done will increase with your Mindpower.
